      "mergeID": "5f0eb9b26ef8a174935c5461",
      "mergedPostDetails": "For avatars with a lot of toggles and settings (body sliders, color adjustments, clothing options, etc) it'd be nice to be able to save your current settings as a preset that you can then apply again later. This way, if you have a favorite avatar that you constantly use with particular settings, you don't have to set them every single time you switch avatar or world. Instead, you can just press a button to apply your preset without any of the hassle.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[FEEDBACK] Add the ability to save current avatar settings as a preset",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "5f0819999e01594ca184a02a",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "_id": "5f0ebb1471a2ca2fe844954f",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68",
        "alias": "Evolutionary Vicuna",
        "aliasID": "65ba088fed6eefce4ca8dc62",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/a96149971e91f0ceb638e9e86cef2b08.gif",
        "created": "2018-04-09T03:11:40.225Z",
        "name": "Tupper - VRChat Head of Community",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": "<redacted>"
      },
      "boardID": "5ed571497ee72a2434704a15",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2020-07-15T08:15:16.124Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "5f0ebb1471a2ca2fe844954f",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I noticed a bunch of people making customizable avatars with shape keys, color of clothes and such, to pretty much make a unique avatar using the action menus. the only issue is, once you change world it all resets. it would be neat if like the \"reset avatar\" button, we could have a \"save state\" where it locally saves the state of your parameters for that that avatar, so switching to and from it/switching worlds remembers the values, until you press reset avatar",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[FEEDBACK] locally \"save\" animator state to reload later",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "5f0819999e01594ca184a02a",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
