      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Oh! I also just figured out how epic this could actually be. Users could make a customization menu where you can go from basic to fully customized with a few sliders and toggles. Multiple users would use the same avatars but look completely different, and it would remain that way! It craps on performance ranking obviously (at least until it gets renovated), but it takes avatars to a new level, allowing users to \"make their own\" avatars without comissioning, asking for a customized version, or learning how to upload their own avatars. This reminds me of a plan I had to make a furry avatar that was completely configurable down to body shape, ear shapes, body colors and patterns, etc with a few preset outfits that can be applied to demonstrate the design.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
