        "like": 4
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would also be very awesome for making avatars more accessible to POC people, because avatars could have skin color sliders (I know its possible now, but needing to fix the skin color after every world hop would likely feel shitty, like being in someone else's body every time you switch worlds). Currently avatar makers have to upload more versions of an avatar to have different skin color options (and they usually don't), so POC people are very limited on avatar choice, and even more limited on what color skin they get when they actually find a darker skin avatar. Being able to save avatar states across worlds would let people choose their actual skin color for their avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
