      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've made a fully colourable Avali avatar that uses 9 parameters for colouring (3 colours with HSV params for each). It's currently very annoying to use it, because the avatar resets to default colours every time you switch worlds or start the game, and it's necessary for people to memorize the values (remember, it's 9 different values) for their colour scheme and manually enter them every time.\nIf parameters were stored and saved, this wouldn't be a problem, and avatars with high customization would be much more usable.",
      "viewerReactions": null
